    apply: "Reflect on a time when God or someone corrected you in love and what you learned. Thank them or God. Ask whether you are neglecting the positive disciplines of prayer, Scripture and fellowship. Pray for your church leaders as they teach and correct. Memorise Hebrews 12:11.",
