    apply: "Examine your own attitude to sin in the church: Do you tend to ignore it or to be harsh? Ask which of the five purposes you most neglect. Pray for your leaders as they weigh these purposes. Discuss with a mature friend how to hold truth and grace. Memorise 1 Corinthians 5:6.",
    activity: "List the five purposes on the board and discuss each with Scripture. Present invented scenarios and ask which purposes apply. Discuss how purposes limit actions (for example, no public humiliation). Pray.",
