    mcq1: ["What does Hebrews 10:24 say?", ["Let us consider how to stir up one another to love and good works", "Let us avoid one another", "Let us stop meeting", "Let us criticise one another"], 0, "Stir up one another."],
    mcq2: ["What does 1 Thessalonians 5:14 say to do for the fainthearted?", ["Encourage them", "Rebuke them", "Ignore them", "Warn them"], 0, "Encourage."],
