    sa: ["What is formative discipline and why does it matter?", ["teaching", "encourage", "accountability", "example", "prevent", "equip"], "A good answer says formative discipline builds up believers through teaching, encouragement, relationships and example, preventing many problems and preparing the church to handle serious cases wisely."],
